      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "けど、身分違いの恋だ。\r\n当然、その仲は続くことなく引き裂かれた。",
        "official_en": "But it all fell apart before long. A future emperor can’t just marry some commoner.",
        "real_en": "But their love crossed class lines, and they were torn apart before it could last."
      },
      "review": {
