    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_003_01:ChrEv_0070_003_01_012:59649798",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0070_003_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0070_003_01_012",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_003_01:ChrEv_0070_003_01_012:59649798",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_003_01:ChrEv_0070_003_01_012:59649798",
        "jp_sha256": "c0980a92643793636c58244a014bea3cf4da2cde660d7add2f3f13b4724a9d4e",
        "official_en_sha256": "73be1c499e839d7b3a89206e159c0d3016e2cd61e7dc5ab8ef397d8f5b03a22a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺はずっとソゼ皇帝が許せなかった。\r\nどんな事情があるにしろ、\r\n母さんを捨てたことに変わりはないからな。",
        "official_en": "I never could forgive Emperor Sozhe for it. Who cares if it was scandalous or not, he basically tossed her aside.",
        "real_en": "I couldn't forgive Emperor Sozhe for a long time. Whatever his reasons, it doesn't change the fact that he abandoned Mom."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
