        "official_en_sha256": "b243657ccc743687ed07808185d3307982ce504df530d79f62aca90d0a2e00dc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "戴冠前の若い頃、ソゼ皇帝は軍に身を置いていて、\r\nそこで給仕係の母さんと出会ったそうだ。",
        "official_en": "In his younger days, before his coronation, Emperor Sozhe served in the military. My mom was one of the mess attendants there, and that’s how they met.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
